# Progress ring (Glass, sandbox).
look glass
ipc sharingdemo peers
wait 1
# MANUAL: open the share sheet (ShareSheet plan) so that peers are shown; steps below assume it is open
ipc sharingdemo sending 25
wait 1
shot ring-25
note Device 1 (centre about (812,486)): accent arc from the top to 3 o'clock, round ends, grey track; compare QML vs Rust (+-1 px stroke).
ipc sharingdemo sending 75
wait 1
shot ring-75
note Arc from the top round to 9 o'clock; same stroke and track as QML.
ipc sharingdemo sending 100
wait 1
shot ring-100
note A full ring with no gap wider than 1 px.
ipc sharingdemo ask
ipc sharingdemo progress 50
wait 1
shot ring-card
note Incoming card: a 4 px ring half way round the 84 px avatar (QML vs Rust).
